  "awakeStep3Title": "Back to bed when sleepy — not when the clock says",
  "@awakeStep3Title": {
    "description": "Step 3 heading. Awake at 3am? (sleep toolkit: the 20-minute rule, used in the middle of the night)."
  },
  "awakeStep3Hint": "Heavy eyes, slow thoughts, a yawn. That's the signal. If it doesn't come, stay up a little longer; if you go back and it doesn't take, do the whole thing again.",
