    "description": "Step 3 hint. Awake at 3am? (sleep toolkit: the 20-minute rule, used in the middle of the night)."
  },
  "awakeStep3Note": "Tomorrow: get up at your usual time however the night went. The sleep pressure you build will make tonight easier. One rough night is survivable; a drifting wake time isn't.",
